<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Kelon sets US$50 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Kelon sets US$50 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's largest refrigerator maker Guangdong Kelon Electrical Holdings Co Ltd has launched a US$50 million term loan facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the amortising loan has a maturity of three years. It pays a margin of 100 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is about 125 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
